:: S1-Prologue-Hub
This is the Prologue stretch of the evening. The Prince fidgets, the old lady steers, Lucinda sighs, and Theodora giggles at all the wrong moments. You, the parrot, may squawk on any subject you please, or press on toward an ending.

[[Steer toward obscenity|S1-Prologue-obscenity-obscenity-reaction-rule-1]]
